; Read-only synchronous-offset ladder at factor 50. Each offset is tested with
; two poisoned/verified 512 KiB reads, then the bus is reset to async.
FailAt 21
Echo "Experimental sync offset ladder: 4, 8, 12 and 15; read-only."
Set u `MCDiag FINDUNIT`
MCDiag UNIT $u SYNC OFFSETS LOG DF0:mcsync-offset.log
Echo "Done. The result is DF0:mcsync-offset.log."
